# GitHub Linguist Language Detection Overrides
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md

# 1. Exclude test suites, test fixtures, and benchmarks from language stats
tests/** linguist-detectable=false
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.npy linguist-detectable=false
*.blz linguist-detectable=false

# 2. Mark Python bindings, Cirq bridge, and examples as vendored
# This ensures GitHub reflects Blaze's true bare-metal engine (Rust + CUDA)
python/** linguist-vendored
